    "sections": {
        "description": "Denton is a theme tailored for dentists and dental clinics. It bundles twenty-one section patterns, four of them alternative heroes, assembled into starter pages for the practice, the treatments, the fees, the team and an individual clinician. With a modern blog layout, the theme lets dental practices communicate with their patients unobtrusively. Eight colour variations provide flexibility, while simple sans-serif typography alongside bolder extended button text keeps the design clean."
